  "body": "Offered to the market for the very first time, this stunning masonry render and mixed materials home present a rare chance to secure a unique coastal holding in one of Auckland's most prestigious suburbs. Cherished by the same family for over 30 years, both residences are now ready for their next chapter. \r\n\r\n3A - Elevated Coastal Living\r\nWake each morning to breath taking sea views, enjoying a lifestyle defined by light, space, and coastal serenity. This beautifully presented home features:\r\n\r\n* 3 spacious bedrooms, including two master ensuites\r\n* A well-appointed family bathroom\r\n* A generous open-plan living zone with a large kitchen\r\n* Expansive living and dining areas designed for effortless everyday comfort\r\n* Internal access double garages\r\n\r\nUnbeatable St Heliers Location\r\nJust moments from the beach, cafes, restaurants, parks, and the vibrant St Heliers village. Families will appreciate zoning for St Heliers Bay School and Glendowie College, two of Auckland's most sought-after schools. Coastal walkways, sports clubs, and public transport are all within easy reach.\r\nThe site is zoned Residential - Terrace Housing and Apartment Buildings, providing future development potential in this blue-chip location.\r\n\r\nProperties of this calibre are tightly held and seldom available. After three decades of family memories, the current owners now pass this special coastal holding to its next custodian.\r\nCall now to view!!!",
